    "answer": {
      "short": "Mary; $f(2x)=6x+6$.",
      "worked": "Mary is correct.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}f(2x)&=3(2x)+6\\\\f(2x)&=6x+6\\end{align*}$$\n\nBob has calculated $2f(x)$ instead:\n\n$$\\begin{align*}2f(x)&=2(3x+6)\\\\2f(x)&=6x+12\\end{align*}$$",
